  <p class="standfirst">A file can upload successfully and still lose the product’s handle in the storefront crop. Check the size of the file and the shape of its display area.</p>

  <p>Reviewed October 20, 2026.</p>

  <h2>What Shopify product image size should you use?</h2>

  <p>For square product images, start at 2048 x 2048 pixels, Shopify’s recommended size. Keep files below 20 MB and check the crop in your theme before preparing the batch. You can make and size the files in hubStudio, then download them and upload them in Shopify’s admin.</p>

